{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Lane f041: claimed via the local CLI at origin/main 441ca94f4a8, after re-signing both certificates (story and epic stale-code -> certified, no LLM). MCP claim_ticket refused because the MCP server's own ticket store holds 6 committed events it could not push (last delivery failure: final-push-rejected). That is a server-side stall, not this lane's store. Per the coordinator, tracker ops fall back to the local CLI while MCP reads stale-store."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792408021749871001,"uuid":"89136442-c6f6-472c-9a01-bd38cdda6f51"}